  "details": "Since getting the \"Holiday Legend\" reward, I've had a notification in my game and on the website I can't delete.\n\nAttempting to delete this notification in game removes it for that session but it returns when I next login.\n\nClicking the 'Delete notification' button does nothing in the browser and checking the dev tools, I can see it's trying to send a POST notification to 'https://vrchat.com/api/1/notifications/not_4b52059e-caf2-46e8-8f74-5d84dc988554/respond' but this is coming back with an Error 500.\n\nCan someone delete this zombie notification for me and check what caused it to get stuck in this invalid state please! :D",
